# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

Security fixes are applied to the latest version on the default branch of
`${repository}`.

## Reporting a Vulnerability

Please do not report security vulnerabilities through public issues, discussions,
or pull requests.

%{ if security_contact != null ~}
Report vulnerabilities privately to ${security_contact}.
%{ else ~}
Report vulnerabilities privately through
[GitHub private vulnerability reporting](https://github.com/${repository}/security/advisories/new).
%{ endif ~}

Include the affected version, reproduction steps, and the potential impact.
You will receive an acknowledgement as soon as possible.
